    "Turning Quests off pauses every active quest, and turning it back on doesn’t restart them. If today’s plan is locked, its reward for today is lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning Quests off pauses every active quest, and turning it back on doesn’t restart them. If today’s plan is locked, its reward for today is lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning a feature off only hides it: nothing is deleted, and its data keeps syncing and stays in your exports. Turning Body off stops reading Apple Health and keeps Activity off iCloud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning a feature off only hides it: nothing is deleted, and its data keeps syncing and stays in your exports. Turning Body off stops reading Apple Health and keeps Activity off iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
