    "While “Fetch exchange rates” is on in Settings, Memoir asks Frankfurter (api.frankfurter.dev) for the European Central Bank’s daily rates of the currencies you spend in. Only the currency codes and a date are sent, never an amount or a note; like any website, Frankfurter sees the request’s network address.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While “Fetch exchange rates” is on in Settings, Memoir asks Frankfurter (api.frankfurter.dev) for the European Central Bank’s daily rates of the currencies you spend in. Only the currency codes and a date are sent, never an amount or a note; like any website, Frankfurter sees the request’s network address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
